# FEAT-039 default danger list. A pass whose PR touches any of these stops at
# the pull request whatever its reach. Installed root-owned to
# /var/lib/buildersinabox/night-shift/guard/danger-paths. A repository can ADD
# patterns through .biab/danger-paths (read from the base commit); it can never
# remove one of these. Matching is case-insensitive; a pattern without `/`
# matches the file name at any depth.
.github/**
.biab/**
.env*
*.pem
*.key
**/secrets*
**/credentials*
firestore.rules
*.rules
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*
*.tf
**/terraform/**
**/migrations/**
**/auth/**
**/*payment*
**/*billing*
**/*stripe*
CODEOWNERS
.gitattributes
package.json
package-lock.json
pnpm-lock.yaml
yarn.lock
requirements*.txt
pyproject.toml
poetry.lock
go.mod
go.sum
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
Gemfile*
# What the next agent or session reads as instructions, or runs on its own:
# a PR that changes these would be the machine writing to itself.
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/**
.mcp.json
.husky/**
.pre-commit-config.yaml
.gitmodules
.npmrc
Makefile
# CI outside GitHub Actions.
.gitlab-ci.yml
.circleci/**
Jenkinsfile
